# Vhost: ds1 (DS Chat Anon).
#
# The application container joins the shared platform_edge network with the
# stable alias ds1-app. The app's own Caddy remains private to its Compose
# project; the platform Caddy is the only Cloudflare Tunnel origin.

ds1.bizshore.net {
	reverse_proxy ds1-app:3000
	encode zstd gzip

	header {
		X-Content-Type-Options nosniff
		X-Frame-Options SAMEORIGIN
		Referrer-Policy strict-origin-when-cross-origin
		Permissions-Policy "geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()"
		-Server
	}
}
